{"id":"f10ac7c238362c10","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-winderstrength.md","title":"Winder rows respect strength and recover a regular order","display":"thm-winderstrength — Winder rows respect strength and recover a regular order","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-winderstrength","aliases":["27-thm-winderstrength"],"display":"thm-winderstrength — Winder rows respect strength and recover a regular order","depends_on":["[[27-df-windermatrix]]","[[27-df-regular]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§8.4 Theorems 8.17–8.18","source_statement":"Winder rows respect strength and recover a regular order","source_printed_pages":"366–367","source_pdf_pages":"390–391","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-winderstrength"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-winderstrength</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-winderstrength — Winder rows respect strength and recover a regular order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d2b23662fef48c79\" href=\"?note=d2b23662fef48c79\" title=\"27-df-windermatrix\">27-df-windermatrix</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" href=\"?note=6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" title=\"27-df-regular\">27-df-regular</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.4 Theorems 8.17–8.18"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f10ac7c238362c10\" href=\"?note=f10ac7c238362c10\" title=\"Winder rows respect strength and recover a regular order\">Winder rows respect strength and recover a regular order</a>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"366–367"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"390–391"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in[n]\">\\(i,j\\in[n]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_i,&gt;_L,\\geq_L\">\\(R_i,&gt;_L,\\geq_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d2b23662fef48c79\" href=\"?note=d2b23662fef48c79\" title=\"27-df-windermatrix\">27-df-windermatrix</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\succeq_f\">\\(\\succeq_f\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Regular}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Regular}_n\\)</span> 与排列集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_n\">\\(S_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" href=\"?note=6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" title=\"27-df-regular\">27-df-regular</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"i\\succeq_f j\\land j\\succeq_f i\\Rightarrow R_i(f)=R_j(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[i\\succeq_f j\\land j\\succeq_f i\\Rightarrow R_i(f)=R_j(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"i\\succeq_f j\\land\\neg(j\\succeq_f i)\\Rightarrow R_i(f)&gt;_L R_j(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[i\\succeq_f j\\land\\neg(j\\succeq_f i)\\Rightarrow R_i(f)&gt;_L R_j(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Regular}_n\\Rightarrow\\forall\\pi\\in S_n\\;\\left(\\left[\\forall r,s\\in[n]\\;(r&lt;s\\Rightarrow R_{\\pi(r)}(f)\\geq_L R_{\\pi(s)}(f))\\right]\\Longleftrightarrow\\left[\\forall r,s\\in[n]\\;(r&lt;s\\Rightarrow\\pi(r)\\succeq_f\\pi(s))\\right]\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in\\mathrm{Regular}_n\\Rightarrow\\forall\\pi\\in S_n\\;\\left(\\left[\\forall r,s\\in[n]\\;(r&lt;s\\Rightarrow R_{\\pi(r)}(f)\\geq_L R_{\\pi(s)}(f))\\right]\\Longleftrightarrow\\left[\\forall r,s\\in[n]\\;(r&lt;s\\Rightarrow\\pi(r)\\succeq_f\\pi(s))\\right]\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>严格强度在最早出现不同的素项次数上产生严格出现次数差，之前次数相同。原书证明利用完整正 DNF 的反链性。没有正则性前提时，矩阵字典序不能反推强度比较；该限制保留在最后一式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-windermatrix","status":"resolved","id":"d2b23662fef48c79","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-windermatrix]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-regular","status":"resolved","id":"6ae49270bb9c0b4f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-regular]]","embed":false},{"target":"Winder rows respect strength and recover a regular order","status":"resolved","id":"f10ac7c238362c10","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · source_statement","heading":"","excerpt":"[[Winder rows respect strength and recover a regular order]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-windermatrix","status":"resolved","id":"d2b23662fef48c79","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$，$i,j\\in[n]$；$R_i,>_L,\\geq_L$ 见 [[27-df-windermatrix]]，$\\succeq_f$、$\\mathrm{Regular}_n$ 与排列集合 $S_n$ 见 [[27-df-regular]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-regular","status":"resolved","id":"6ae49270bb9c0b4f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$，$i,j\\in[n]$；$R_i,>_L,\\geq_L$ 见 [[27-df-windermatrix]]，$\\succeq_f$、$\\mathrm{Regular}_n$ 与排列集合 $S_n$ 见 [[27-df-regular]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\in[n]","display":false},{"tex":"R_i,>_L,\\geq_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\succeq_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Regular}_n","display":false},{"tex":"S_n","display":false},{"tex":"i\\succeq_f j\\land j\\succeq_f i\\Rightarrow R_i(f)=R_j(f).","display":true},{"tex":"i\\succeq_f j\\land\\neg(j\\succeq_f i)\\Rightarrow R_i(f)>_L R_j(f).","display":true},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Regular}_n\\Rightarrow\\forall\\pi\\in S_n\\;\\left(\\left[\\forall r,s\\in[n]\\;(r<s\\Rightarrow R_{\\pi(r)}(f)\\geq_L R_{\\pi(s)}(f))\\right]\\Longleftrightarrow\\left[\\forall r,s\\in[n]\\;(r<s\\Rightarrow\\pi(r)\\succeq_f\\pi(s))\\right]\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1705,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-80","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-winderstrength|thm-winderstrength — Winder rows respect strength and recover a regular order]]"}],"outgoing":["d2b23662fef48c79","6ae49270bb9c0b4f"]}